                <div>
                    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary font-semibold">Admissions Enquiry</p>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mt-3 text-balance">Let&#x27;s start the
                        conversation.</h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground max-w-md">Share a few details and our admissions team will
                        personally reach out to schedule a campus visit and guide you through next steps.</p>
                    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24"
                                height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                                class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-primary mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
                                <path
                                    d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0">
                                </path>
                                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
                            </svg><span>Gulmohar Cross Road No. 9, JVPD Scheme, Juhu, Mumbai 400049</span></li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24"
                                height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                                class="lucide lucide-phone h-5 w-5 text-primary mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
                                <path
                                    d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384">
                                </path>
                            </svg><a href="tel:+912261306130" class="hover:text-primary">+91 2261306130</a></li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24"
                                height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                                class="lucide lucide-mail h-5 w-5 text-primary mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
                                <path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path>
                                <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
                            </svg><a href="mailto:admission@ecolemondiale.org"
                                class="hover:text-primary">admission@ecolemondiale.org</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <form class="leadForm rounded-3xl bg-card border border-border p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-elegant space-y-4">

                    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div class="space-y-1.5">
                            <label class="text-sm font-medium">Parent Name *</label>
                            <input name="parentName" required
                                class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm" />
                            <p class="text-red-500 text-sm hidden" data-error="parentName"></p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-1.5">
                            <label class="text-sm font-medium">Child's Name *</label>
                            <input name="childName" required
                                class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm" />
                            <p class="text-red-500 text-sm hidden" data-error="childName"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div class="space-y-1.5">
                            <label class="text-sm font-medium">Grade Applying For *</label>
                            <select name="gradeApplyingFor" required
                                class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm">
                                <option value="">Select Grade</option>
                                <option value="Nursery">Nursery</option>
                                <option value="Junior KG">Junior KG</option>
                                <option value="Senior KG">Senior KG</option>
                                <option value="Grade 1">Grade 1</option>
                                <option value="Grade 2">Grade 2</option>
                                <option value="Grade 3">Grade 3</option>
                                <option value="Grade 4">Grade 4</option>
                                <option value="Grade 5">Grade 5</option>
                                <option value="Grade 6">Grade 6</option>
                                <option value="Grade 7">Grade 7</option>
                                <option value="Grade 8">Grade 8</option>
                                <option value="Grade 9">Grade 9</option>
                                <option value="Grade 10">Grade 10</option>
                                <option value="Grade 11">Grade 11</option>
                                <option value="Grade 12">Grade 12</option>
                            </select>
                            <p class="text-red-500 text-sm hidden" data-error="gradeApplyingFor"></p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-1.5">
                            <label class="text-sm font-medium">Academic Year *</label>
                            <select name="academicYear" required
                                class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm">
                                <option value="">Select Academic Year</option>
                                <option value="2026-2027" selected>2026-2027</option>
                                <option value="2027-2028">2027-2028</option>
                                <option value="2028-2029">2028-2029</option>
                            </select>
                            <p class="text-red-500 text-sm hidden" data-error="academicYear"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-1.5">
                        <label class="text-sm font-medium">Email *</label>
                        <input type="email" name="email" required
                            class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm" />
                        <p class="text-red-500 text-sm hidden" data-error="email"></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-1.5">
                        <label class="text-sm font-medium">Phone *</label>
                        <input type="tel" name="phone" maxlength="10" required
                            class="flex h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-sm" />
                        <p class="text-red-500 text-sm hidden" data-error="phone"></p>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit"
                        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full h-10 rounded-md px-8 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/90 cursor-pointer">
                        Submit Enquiry
                    </button>
                </form>
                <script>
                    const scriptURL = "https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbz1-3PJy_xWGK5eQgYIWaF6h_c9bGbzBKbrW4drxnnP0-uokuXlLaymyGTap7odKKDdkw/exec";

                    function showError(form, fieldName, message) {
                        const errorEl = form.querySelector(`[data-error="${fieldName}"]`);
                        if (errorEl) {
                            errorEl.innerText = message;
                            errorEl.classList.remove("hidden");
                        }
                    }

                    function clearErrors(form) {
                        form.querySelectorAll("[data-error]").forEach(el => {
                            el.innerText = "";
                            el.classList.add("hidden");
                        });
                    }

                    function validateForm(form, data) {
                        clearErrors(form);
                        let valid = true;

                        const nameRegex = /^[A-Za-z\s]+$/;
                        const emailRegex = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/;
                        const phoneRegex = /^[0-9]{10}$/;

                        if (!data.parentName || !nameRegex.test(data.parentName)) {
                            showError(form, "parentName", "Enter valid parent name");
                            valid = false;
                        }

                        if (!data.childName || !nameRegex.test(data.childName)) {
                            showError(form, "childName", "Enter valid child name");
                            valid = false;
                        }

                        if (!data.gradeApplyingFor) {
                            showError(form, "gradeApplyingFor", "Select grade");
                            valid = false;
                        }

                        if (!data.academicYear) {
                            showError(form, "academicYear", "Select academic year");
                            valid = false;
                        }

                        if (!emailRegex.test(data.email)) {
                            showError(form, "email", "Enter valid email");
                            valid = false;
                        }

                        if (!phoneRegex.test(data.phone)) {
                            showError(form, "phone", "Phone must be 10 digits");
                            valid = false;
                        }

                        return valid;
                    }

                    document.querySelectorAll(".leadForm").forEach(form => {
                        const phoneInput = form.querySelector('[name="phone"]');
                        const submitBtn = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');

                        if (phoneInput) {
                            phoneInput.addEventListener("input", function () {
                                this.value = this.value.replace(/\D/g, "").slice(0, 10);
                            });
                        }

                        form.addEventListener("submit", async function (e) {
                            e.preventDefault();

                            const data = {
                                parentName: form.parentName.value.trim(),
                                childName: form.childName.value.trim(),
                                gradeApplyingFor: form.gradeApplyingFor.value,
                                academicYear: form.academicYear.value,
                                email: form.email.value.trim(),
                                phone: form.phone.value.trim()
                            };

                            if (!validateForm(form, data)) return;

                            const originalText = submitBtn.innerText;
                            submitBtn.disabled = true;
                            submitBtn.innerText = "Submitting...";

                            try {
                                await fetch(scriptURL, {
                                    method: "POST",
                                    mode: "no-cors",
                                    body: JSON.stringify(data)
                                });

                                form.reset();
                                window.location.href = "/thankyou.html";

                                if (form.academicYear) {
                                    form.academicYear.value = "2026-2027";
                                }

                            } catch (error) {
                                console.error(error);
                                alert("Something went wrong. Please try again.");

                            } finally {
                                submitBtn.disabled = false;
                                submitBtn.innerText = originalText;
                            }
                        });

                    });
                </script>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section id="faq" class="py-20 sm:py-28">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
                <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary font-semibold">Frequently Asked</p>
                    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mt-3 text-balance">Answers for prospective
                        parents.</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-12 divide-y divide-border border-y border-border">
                    <details class="group py-5">
                        <summary class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none"><span
                                class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">
                                How can my child enroll at École Mondiale?
                            </span><span
                                class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-muted text-primary grid place-items-center transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-lg">+</span>
                        </summary>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">We would be delighted to meet with you and discuss the
                            details. Please contact our admissions
                            office on <a class="text-color" href="tel:+912261306130">+91 22 61306130</a> Or on email
                            at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:admission@ecolemondiale.org"
                                class="text-color">admission@ecolemondiale.org</a></p>

                    </details>
                    <details class="group py-5">
                        <summary class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none"><span
                                class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Which programmes can my child
                                join?</span><span
                                class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-muted text-primary grid place-items-center transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-lg">+</span>
                        </summary>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">We offer the full IB Continuum: Primary Years (3-11),
                            Middle Years (11-16) and the IB Diploma Programme (16-18).</p>
                    </details>
                    <details class="group py-5">
                        <summary class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none"><span
                                class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">
                                Can any student enroll in an IB Diploma programme?
                            </span><span
                                class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-muted text-primary grid place-items-center transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-lg">+</span>
                        </summary>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">Students must be enrolled in an IB authorized school to
                            participate in an IB programme. The IB programmes are the core of all curriculum at École
                            Mondiale and students joining early are well prepared for the rigorous IB Diploma programme.
                            Although entry to the IB Diploma is open to all students entering grade 11, the advice is
                            given by the coordinator and teachers as to which course and subject combination is most
                            suitable for each student.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details class="group py-5">
                        <summary class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between gap-4 list-none"><span
